flowchart TD
  A[Android posts notification] --> B[Kotlin NotificationListenerService]
  B --> C{App excluded?}
  C -->|Yes| X[Discard without persisting content]
  C -->|No| D[Extract allowed fields]
  D --> E[Sensitive-data screen and redact]
  E --> F{Safe to retain?}
  F -->|No| X
  F -->|Yes| G[Persist event in local SQLite]
  G --> H[Queue lightweight analysis]
  H --> I[Rules and deterministic parser]
  I --> J{Confidence enough?}
  J -->|Yes| K[Store derived classification]
  J -->|No| L[Optional local Qwen inference]
  L --> M[Validate structured result]
  M --> K
  K --> N[FTS index and inbox update]
  N --> O[Digest and aggregate insights]
